stimulus.description:
A fitness app counts the days on which a user is active. The minimum for an active day is 5000 steps. Write the StepTracker class described below.
```java
public class StepTracker {
    // to be written in this question:
    //   constructor StepTracker(int minActive)
    //   void addDailySteps(int steps)
    //   int activeDays()
    //   double averageSteps()
}
```

parts.model_answer:
One correct implementation (ALTON reference answer):
```java
public class StepTracker {
    private int minActive;
    private int totalSteps;
    private int days;
    private int active;

    public StepTracker(int minActive) {
        this.minActive = minActive;
        totalSteps = 0;
        days = 0;
        active = 0;
    }
    public void addDailySteps(int steps) {
        totalSteps += steps;
        days++;
        if (steps >= minActive) {
            active++;
        }
    }
    public int activeDays() {
        return active;
    }
    public double averageSteps() {
        if (days == 0) {
            return 0.0;
        }
        return (double) totalSteps / days;
    }
}
```

